of the few remaining DEC 3000 owners since it's virtually impossible
to find the newer SROM chip and the version 7 firmware has been
required since OpenVMS 7.x (or so it appears).

Of course, everything that I've said here is based on others'
experiences.  This is just the information that I've gathered this
afternoon.


